// Saves while a when block collects the rules of its insertions (in the
// inserted beat, before its when block), in a rule brought by an insertion, in
// the rest of the inserted beat, and through a cascade of insertions.

state
  angry: true

beat Start
  Talk()
  Greet("Bob")

beat Talk
  when
    + Moods
    true
      Hello.
  Talk done.

beat Moods
  Moods prologue.

  when
    angry
      Get out!
  Moods epilogue.

beat Greet(name)
  when first
    + Formal(name)
    true
      Hi.
  Greet done.

beat Formal(who)
  when
    + Titles(who)
    who is "Ana"
      Good day, Ana.

beat Titles(person)
  Checking titles for $person.

  when
    person is "Bob"
      Sir Bob.
  Titles epilogue.

